        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "New To Market\r\nBy Public Auction\r\nBoherkyle Castlecomer Co Kilkenny\r\nGuide Price €285,000\r\n\r\nSale of detached dormer cottage style residence 1,128 sq ft., standing on circa 16 acres with road frontage.\r\nResidence consists of entrance hall, sitting room, living room, kitchen/dining area, hallway leading to toilet/shower, bedroom. First floor 2 bedrooms.  PVC Double glazed windows. Ber Rating F.    This residence is in good condition and ready to be lived in.\r\nFront/side garden area and rear yard with old stone very well-maintained outbuildings, two span round roof shed, three span lean two, cattle crush.\r\nThe circa 16 acres are divided into two individual fields, surrounds the residence and buildings.  The lands are of good grazing quality suitable for hay/ silage. The lands have gateway access to public road.  Site potential subject to planning.\r\nEir Code R95 DK7A.  Situated approximately 1-mile Castlecomer, 13 miles Kilkenny city, 15 miles Carlow, 20 miles Portlaoise.\r\nSolrs: Cormac Mullen O’Connor Mullen 1 Glena Terrace Spawell Road Wexford (053) 9198555\r\nFor Sale by Public Auction on Friday 9th October at 3pm \r\nAt The Auction Room Ballycomey House Castlecomer Co Kilkenny"
      },
